{
  "id": "6418684fa20576001c943f0f",
  "title": "井戸端の手入れ",
  "created": 1679321170,
  "updated": 1787191550,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6418684fa20576001c943f0f",
      "text": "井戸端の手入れ",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679321170,
      "updated": 1679321170
    },
    {
      "id": "641868555e90c00000cd79da",
      "text": " [赤リンクの穴を埋める]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1679321170,
      "updated": 1787089103
    },
    {
      "id": "641871c0e5172d0000f8083a",
      "text": "  穴とは思ってなかった[yosider.icon][takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1679323584,
      "updated": 1679371273
    },
    {
      "id": "64192c0b1280f00000993ec6",
      "text": "  どっちかというと、[赤リンクを作りまくる]のが手入れになりそう[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679371276,
      "updated": 1694060042
    },
    {
      "id": "6418685c5e90c00000cd79dc",
      "text": " 箇条書きを埋めかえる",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679321177,
      "updated": 1679321194
    },
    {
      "id": "641871cae5172d0000f8083b",
      "text": "  とはどういう操作のことだろう[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1679323594,
      "updated": 1679323611
    },
    {
      "id": "64192be41280f00000993ec5",
      "text": "  入れ替えではなくて？[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1679371236,
      "updated": 1679371243
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84d3350000000000dd7089",
      "text": "  [根回し]のことじゃないかな [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787089717,
      "updated": 1787089747
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84d35e0000000000dd708a",
      "text": "   ページの切り出し（株分け）がやりやすいように箇条書きを整える作業",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787089759,
      "updated": 1787089834
    },
    {
      "id": "6418686d5e90c00000cd79dd",
      "text": " [日記に水やり]",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679321194,
      "updated": 1694060026
    },
    {
      "id": "64192c241280f00000993ec7",
      "text": "  インクが滲んじゃう～[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1679371301,
      "updated": 1679371307
    },
    {
      "id": "641868ba5e90c00000cd79de",
      "text": " 茂った箇条書きを切り出して盆栽にする",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679321270,
      "updated": 1679321313
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84d3e90000000000dd708b",
      "text": "  盆栽にする = 鉢に移すということだろうか。よくわからない [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787089898,
      "updated": 1787089995
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84d46a0000000000dd708c",
      "text": "  [ページの切り出し]については、株分けとか移植というイメージがある",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787090026,
      "updated": 1787090084
    },
    {
      "id": "641871ec32ef920000c4d260",
      "text": " かき混ぜ（ほどほどに",
      "userId": "5ca094b00af7b0001732ef92",
      "created": 1679323627,
      "updated": 1679323644
    },
    {
      "id": "64192d5e1280f00000993ec8",
      "text": "  沈殿物が浮かび上がってくる",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1679371615,
      "updated": 1679371620
    },
    {
      "id": "641ffa7ce6003500006ed692",
      "text": "  cf. [井戸浚い]",
      "userId": "62a91a7a083437001de60035",
      "created": 1679817342,
      "updated": 1679817353
    },
    {
      "id": "641931261280f000005b9e17",
      "text": " 苔をとる",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1679372583,
      "updated": 1679372586
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84dcd30000000000061aa1",
      "text": " 庭木を植える",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1787092180,
      "updated": 1787092191
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84dcde0000000000061aa2",
      "text": " 収穫する",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1787092191,
      "updated": 1787092200
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8503480000000000451db3",
      "text": " 病害虫防除",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1787102024,
      "updated": 1787120280
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8548a90000000000cce4d6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787119786,
      "updated": 1787119786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a853f6d00000000008aefa4",
      "text": " 農薬散布",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787117422,
      "updated": 1787117426
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85406b00000000008aefa9",
      "text": " 標本採取、見本作成",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787117676,
      "updated": 1787134175
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8543fc00000000008aefb3",
      "text": " 　個人projectへのページ複製",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118589,
      "updated": 1787118685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85445c00000000008aefb6",
      "text": " 　ページ内の枝葉のまとめ直し",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118685,
      "updated": 1787118685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8544bb00000000008aefba",
      "text": " 　引用、脚注つきでのコメントほか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118780,
      "updated": 1787118799
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85443500000000008aefb4",
      "text": " 　人間観察",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118646,
      "updated": 1787118832
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8543a700000000008aefb1",
      "text": " 虫相撲",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118504,
      "updated": 1787118558
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85415800000000008aefaa",
      "text": " 松明を設置する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787117913,
      "updated": 1787117972
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8541da00000000008aefad",
      "text": " 　湧き潰し（とは？）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118043,
      "updated": 1787118863
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85418d00000000008aefab",
      "text": " 作業台でクラフティング",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787117972,
      "updated": 1787118007
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85446d00000000008aefb7",
      "text": " 　UserCSSで記法を追加、スタイル指定の変更等",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118702,
      "updated": 1787118929
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85447f00000000008aefb8",
      "text": " 　既存ページをもとにして新しい何かをつくる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118720,
      "updated": 1787118748
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8541c800000000008aefac",
      "text": " レッドストーンで自動化",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118025,
      "updated": 1787118481
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85449f00000000008aefb9",
      "text": " 　UserScript",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787118752,
      "updated": 1787118759
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85472e0000000000cce4d2",
      "text": " ブランチマイニング",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787119407,
      "updated": 1787119410
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85473c0000000000cce4d4",
      "text": " 　一定のルールに沿って継続的にページを作成・保守することで「原石」を採掘していく",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787119422,
      "updated": 1787123042
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85cf710000000000a3b26b",
      "text": " 　あらゆる文字列をページにしよう()[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1787154289,
      "updated": 1787154346
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863ecb000000000002fe58",
      "text": " 　　それは[無限の猿定理]や[亞書]を思い出す[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787182796,
      "updated": 1787182983
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863f2f000000000002fe59",
      "text": " 　　 [>_ [@horicun 2026-08-12 · 19:00 https://x.com/horicun/status/2087479234319245806] 【つくった】 サーバーに住む猿が30秒に1文字を生成し「走れメロス」全文との完全一致を目指し続けるサイト「無限の猿定理シミュレーター」をつくりました。いつか起きる奇跡を信じて、猿をみんなで見守ろう☺️ #無限の猿定理シミュレーター https://horicun.moo.jp/saru/ 【添付画像2件】]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787182896,
      "updated": 1787183171
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8547c20000000000cce4d5",
      "text": " 原石・鉱石の精錬と加工",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787119555,
      "updated": 1787119575
    },
    {
      "id": "641868575e90c00000cd79db",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679321171,
      "updated": 1679371753
    },
    {
      "id": "64192de85e90c00000e8edc0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679371753,
      "updated": 1679371761
    },
    {
      "id": "64186895b8bbfc0000ba7bf3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1679321237,
      "updated": 1679321237
    },
    {
      "id": "64186895b8bbfc0000ba7bf4",
      "text": "関連: [Scrapboxの手入れ]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1679321237,
      "updated": 1679321260
    },
    {
      "id": "64186896b8bbfc0000ba7bf5",
      "text": "　先行する手入れの例があったので何故か作物的イメージを追加したのがこのページ[cFQ2f7LRuLYP.icon]",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679321239,
      "updated": 1679371793
    },
    {
      "id": "64192e315e90c00000e8edc2",
      "text": "　　だがよくわからんくなった",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1679371826,
      "updated": 1679371833
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85acba0000000000b2c57f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787145402,
      "updated": 1787145402
    },
    {
      "id": "64192df15e90c00000e8edc1",
      "text": " [デジタルガーデン] - 庭園のメタファ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1679371762,
      "updated": 1787145402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84d2c50000000000dd7088",
      "text": " [エバーグリーンノート] - 常緑樹のメタファ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787089605,
      "updated": 1787089641
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84d2a50000000000dd7087",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787089573,
      "updated": 1787089573
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8660fc000000000046968a",
      "text": "[井戸端利用の心得?]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787191548,
      "updated": 1787191550
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85af6e00000000003010d6",
      "text": "[井戸端の心理的安全性]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787146094,
      "updated": 1787146109
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85aedd00000000003010d4",
      "text": "[井戸端外から来た人がギョッとしそうなこと]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787145949,
      "updated": 1787145954
    },
    {
      "id": "6a85aee100000000003010d5",
